          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Narcissus obesus is a species of the genus Narcissus (Daffodils) in the family Amaryllidaceae. It is classified in Section Bulbocodium. It is native to Spain, Portugal and Morocco."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p3",
            "text": " Description \nFlowers solitary, horizontal to erect, floral tube and tepals yellow."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p4",
            "text": " Distribution and habitat \nRocky cliffs, dunes and meadows, calcareous or acid soil."
          }
